Description: desktop client for SvxLink reflectors
 A Qt desktop client for SvxLink reflectors speaking protocol v3 — mutual TLS,
 AES-128-GCM encrypted Opus audio over UDP. Monitor several talkgroups at once,
 see who is talking on which, switch by priority or by hand, and transmit.
 .
 Provides a global push-to-talk shortcut with a genuine key release, using the
 XDG desktop portal, so it works while the window is unfocused and on both
 Wayland and X11 without any elevated permission.
 .
 It shares one identity with the svxconnect terminal client: the same
 configuration file, the same client certificate and a shared run lock, so
 whichever of the two is running holds the reflector connection and the other
 refuses to start rather than fighting over it.
